{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/423ae7c06cbef20a8f79bc772109352d.poster.avif?t=1760675219\" width=366 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/423ae7c06cbef20a8f79bc772109352d.webm?t=1760675219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/423ae7c06cbef20a8f79bc772109352d.mp4?t=1760675219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cartoon killers</strong> is a video game inspired by the iconic Team Fortress 2 and by cartoons from what the devs can pull out of their heads, and with intentionally coded &quot;game mechanics&quot; , and tons of characters to customize and master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/2c4a0db7f2c14f7c870e65a5f4b965c3.avif?t=1760675219\" data-has-big width=1560 height=409 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as a band of <strong>misfits</strong> inspired by your favorite <strong>boomer shooter</strong> and watch as they all collectively gladiate against each other in a battle verse <strong>red and blue</strong> over nonsensical <strong>control</strong> <strong>points, flags, and payloads!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/80d8dc7bd509ca06a85d6716c2193c91.poster.avif?t=1760675219\" width=366 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/80d8dc7bd509ca06a85d6716c2193c91.webm?t=1760675219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kill each other :) (in game lol)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/1dd6066244af43b5cc9e7dca19a610ef.avif?t=1760675219\" width=341 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have fun taking over ether by being a sweat in a lobby or being a silly friendly with a meal to give to\u00a0 <br>the people you love!\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/b667aa39b5992f27524bc3e62376d6ff.avif?t=1760675219\" width=544 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Try to figure out which art style we use!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/0fb16e22438fe0ec72eb7ba3d456f42d.avif?t=1760675219\" width=900 height=594 /></span>Have silly moments in-game! such as this...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077200/extras/2f5cd3e721144ffe9e1e8401e8453061.avif?t=1760675219\" width=900 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or kill each other over random crap that happens in game because life happens :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span cl